msgstr "其他有效的修正方法"

msgid "Comment"
msgstr "评论"

msgid "Please say what should change: a suggested title or description, other valid repairs, or a comment."
msgstr "请说明应修改什么：建议的标题或描述、其他有效的修正方法，或一条评论。"

msgid "Category"
msgstr "类别"

msgid "Where (file and lines, or section)"
msgstr "位置（文件和行号，或章节）"

msgid "What would change"
msgstr "会改变什么"

msgid "Why it matters"
msgstr "为什么重要"

msgid "Suggested fix"
msgstr "建议的修正"

msgid "Not sure"
msgstr "不确定"

msgid "Your question to the team"
msgstr "您想问团队的问题"

msgid "The team has frozen your review; it can no longer be changed."
msgstr "团队已冻结您的审阅，无法再修改。"

msgid "The proposal was deleted."
msgstr "提议已删除。"

msgid "Your proposal was saved."
msgstr "您的提议已保存。"

msgid "Your question was sent to the team. Their answer will appear here."
msgstr "您的问题已发送给团队。团队的回答将显示在这里。"

msgid "Please write your question first."
msgstr "请先写下您的问题。"

msgid "Version %(n)s confirmed. You can still revise it until the team freezes your review."
msgstr "已确认第 %(n)s 版。在团队冻结您的审阅之前，您仍可修改。"

msgid "Confidential: these items are the benchmark's answers. Please do not publish or share them."
msgstr "保密：这些条目是评测基准的答案。请勿公开或分享。"

msgid "Version %(n)s, confirmed %(date)s UTC"
msgstr "第 %(n)s 版，确认于 %(date)s（UTC）"

msgid "Proposed additions"
msgstr "提议新增的条目"

msgid "I understand that the finished task, built from my package, will be sent through their APIs to each AI company whose models are evaluated, which receives it and may keep it."
msgstr "我了解：根据我的材料构建的最终任务，将通过各家 AI 公司的 API 发送给模型接受评测的每一家公司；这些公司会收到并可能保存该任务。"

msgid "Taking part requires this acknowledgement."
msgstr "参与需要您确认此项。"

msgid "I understand that the finished task, built from this paper's package and the reviews, will be sent through their APIs to each AI company whose models are evaluated, which receives it and may keep it."
msgstr "我了解：根据这篇论文的材料和审阅意见构建的最终任务，将通过各家 AI 公司的 API 发送给模型接受评测的每一家公司；这些公司会收到并可能保存该任务。"

msgid "May the team use AI services with my unpublished materials and my responses?"
msgstr "团队可以将 AI 服务用于我未公开的材料和我的回复吗？"

msgid "DeepEcon contributor site"
msgstr "DeepEcon 贡献者网站"

msgid "Interface language"
msgstr "界面语言"

msgid "Change"
msgstr "切换"

msgid "This site sends nothing to AI services and loads nothing from other websites."
msgstr "本网站不向任何 AI 服务发送内容，也不从其他网站加载任何内容。"

msgid "Original"
msgstr "原始版本"

msgid "lines %(a)s–%(b)s"
msgstr "第 %(a)s–%(b)s 行"

msgid "Modified"
msgstr "修改后"

msgid "Where"
msgstr "位置"

msgid "Affects"
msgstr "影响"

msgid "Consequence"
msgstr "后果"

msgid "What a correct answer must do"
msgstr "正确答案必须做到什么"

msgid "Acceptable repair or work"
msgstr "可接受的修正或工作"

msgid "Critical requirements"
msgstr "关键要求"

msgid "Weight: %(w)s"
msgstr "权重：%(w)s"

msgid "Work on this paper?"
msgstr "要审阅这篇论文吗？"

msgid "From now on, your personal link will open this paper."
msgstr "从现在起，您的个人链接将打开这篇论文。"

msgid "Your work on “%(title)s” is kept. You can return to it at any time through “Choose another paper”."
msgstr "您在《%(title)s》上的工作会被保留。您可以随时通过“选择其他论文”回到那篇论文。"

msgid "Work on this paper"
msgstr "审阅这篇论文"

msgid "Back to the list of papers"
msgstr "返回论文列表"

msgid "Review and confirm"
msgstr "检查并确认"

msgid "These are your answers, in your own words. Confirming saves them as a numbered version; you can still revise them until the team freezes your review."
msgstr "以下是您用自己的话写下的回答。确认后会保存为一个带编号的版本；在团队冻结您的审阅之前，您仍可修改。"

msgid "%(done)s of %(total)s reviewed, about %(minutes)s minutes left"
msgstr "已审阅 %(done)s / %(total)s 项，约剩 %(minutes)s 分钟"

msgid "Item"
msgstr "条目"

msgid "Your answer"
msgstr "您的回答"

msgid "Your words"
msgstr "您的文字"

msgid "AI helped"
msgstr "AI 有协助"

msgid "Not reviewed yet"
msgstr "尚未审阅"

msgid "Your proposals"
msgstr "您的提议"

msgid "Confirm this version"
msgstr "确认此版本"

msgid "Confirmed versions"
msgstr "已确认的版本"

msgid "Version %(n)s, %(date)s UTC"
msgstr "第 %(n)s 版，%(date)s（UTC）"

msgid "Download my review"
msgstr "下载我的审阅"

msgid "This link does not work"
msgstr "此链接无法使用"

msgid "It may have expired or been replaced. Please ask the team for a new link."
msgstr "链接可能已过期或已被替换。请向团队索取新链接。"

msgid "My paper"
msgstr "我的论文"

msgid "Task version: %(version)s"
msgstr "任务版本：%(version)s"

msgid "What we ask"
msgstr "我们请您做什么"

msgid "We are building a benchmark that tests whether AI systems can do economics research well. For this paper the team prepared items: deliberate modifications made to build a benchmark task, not claims about the published paper. Please judge whether each item is realistic and consequential, and whether its repair is right."
msgstr "我们正在构建一个评测基准，检验 AI 系统能否胜任经济学研究。团队为这篇论文准备了若干条目：这些是为构建评测任务而有意做出的修改，并非对已发表论文的论断。请判断每个条目是否现实可信、是否有实质性影响，以及其修正是否正确。"

msgid "The prepared items"
msgstr "已准备的条目"

msgid "%(counter)s item"
msgid_plural "%(counter)s items"
msgstr[0] "%(counter)s 个条目"

msgid "Continue the review"
msgstr "继续审阅"

msgid "Start the review"
msgstr "开始审阅"

msgid "Propose an addition"
msgstr "提议新增条目"

msgid "%(counter)s proposal so far."
msgid_plural "%(counter)s proposals so far."
msgstr[0] "目前有 %(counter)s 条提议。"

msgid "Last confirmed: version %(n)s."
msgstr "最近确认：第 %(n)s 版。"

msgid "The review screen is not available yet; the team will tell you when it opens."
msgstr "审阅页面尚未开放；开放时团队会通知您。"

msgid "Ask the team"
msgstr "向团队提问"

msgid "You"
msgstr "您"

msgid "Team"
msgstr "团队"

msgid "Waiting for the team's answer."
msgstr "等待团队回答。"

msgid "Send to the team"
msgstr "发送给团队"

msgid "The task package"
msgstr "任务包"

msgid "This is the package an evaluated AI system receives. You may download it for your review."
msgstr "这是接受评测的 AI 系统所收到的任务包。您可以下载它用于审阅。"

msgid "Download the task package"
msgstr "下载任务包"

msgid "Review or change your choices on the notice"
msgstr "查看或修改您在须知页面上的选择"

msgid "Choose another paper"
msgstr "选择其他论文"

msgid "Please use your personal link"
msgstr "请使用您的个人链接"

msgid "This site opens only through the personal link the team sent you. There is no sign-up and no search."
msgstr "本网站只能通过团队发给您的个人链接打开，无需注册，也没有搜索功能。"

msgid "If your link no longer works, please ask the team for a new one."
msgstr "如果您的链接已无法使用，请向团队索取新链接。"

msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "开始之前"

msgid "What this is"
msgstr "这是什么"

msgid "The team has prepared items for a benchmark task built from your paper. The items are deliberate modifications made to build the task, not claims about your published paper. You review them: keep, change, reject, or mark as unsure, and you may propose others."
msgstr "团队已根据您的论文，为一项评测基准任务准备了若干条目。这些条目是为构建任务而有意做出的修改，并非对您已发表论文的论断。请您逐条审阅：保留、修改、拒绝或标记为不确定，也可以提出新的条目。"

msgid "The team has prepared items for a benchmark task built from this paper. The items are deliberate modifications made to build the task, not claims about the published paper. You review them: keep, change, reject, or mark as unsure, and you may propose others."
msgstr "团队已根据这篇论文，为一项评测基准任务准备了若干条目。这些条目是为构建任务而有意做出的修改，并非对已发表论文的论断。请您逐条审阅：保留、修改、拒绝或标记为不确定，也可以提出新的条目。"

msgid "What is stored, and who sees it"
msgstr "保存哪些内容，谁能看到"

msgid "Your decisions, comments, proposals, and uploaded files, with their dates."
msgstr "您的决定、评论、提议和上传的文件，以及相应的日期。"

msgid "Only the project team sees them; other contributors do not."
msgstr "只有项目团队能看到；其他贡献者看不到。"

msgid "What happens to the finished task"
msgstr "最终任务将如何使用"

msgid "The finished task, built from your package, is used to evaluate AI models. It is sent through their APIs to each AI company whose models are evaluated, which receives it and may keep it."
msgstr "根据您的材料构建的最终任务将用于评测 AI 模型。它会通过 API 发送给模型接受评测的每一家 AI 公司；这些公司会收到并可能保存该任务。"

msgid "The finished task, built from this paper's package and the reviews, is used to evaluate AI models. It is sent through their APIs to each AI company whose models are evaluated, which receives it and may keep it."
msgstr "根据这篇论文的材料和审阅意见构建的最终任务将用于评测 AI 模型。它会通过 API 发送给模型接受评测的每一家 AI 公司；这些公司会收到并可能保存该任务。"

msgid "The task may later be published. Your reviews, comments, and messages are not published."
msgstr "该任务以后可能会公开发布。您的审阅意见、评论和留言不会公开。"

msgid "What we ask of you"
msgstr "我们请您做到"

msgid "Please keep the items confidential: do not publish or share them."
msgstr "请对这些条目保密：不要公开或分享。"

msgid "If you use AI tools, write what you submit in your own words, tell us when AI helped, and never put restricted, confidential, or licensed data into an AI tool."
msgstr "如果您使用 AI 工具，请用自己的话撰写提交的内容，在 AI 提供帮助时告诉我们，并且切勿将受限、保密或受许可限制的数据输入 AI 工具。"

msgid "You may withdraw at any time by telling the team; your reviews, proposals, and uploads are then deleted."
msgstr "您可以随时告知团队退出；届时您的审阅意见、提议和上传内容将被删除。"

msgid "You last confirmed these choices on %(date)s. You can change them below."
msgstr "您最近一次确认这些选择是在 %(date)s。您可以在下方修改。"

msgid "Either answer is fine. You can change it later."
msgstr "两种回答都可以，之后也可以修改。"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "继续"

msgid "Choose a paper"
msgstr "选择论文"

msgid "Your personal link opens one paper at a time: the one you choose here. You can change it at any time, and your work on each paper is kept."
msgstr "您的个人链接每次只打开一篇论文，即您在此处选择的那一篇。您可以随时更换，您在每篇论文上的工作都会被保留。"

msgid "Your current paper"
msgstr "您当前的论文"

msgid "Continue with this paper"
msgstr "继续审阅这篇论文"

msgid "Other papers you can choose"
msgstr "您可以选择的其他论文"

msgid "Papers you can choose"
msgstr "您可以选择的论文"

msgid "You have opened this paper before; your choices on it are kept."
msgstr "您之前打开过这篇论文，您对它所做的选择已被保留。"

msgid "Choose this paper"
msgstr "选择这篇论文"

msgid "No other papers are open to you at the moment. The team will tell you when there are more."
msgstr "目前没有其他可供您选择的论文。有新的论文时，团队会通知您。"

msgid "No papers are open to you yet. The team will tell you when there are some."
msgstr "目前还没有可供您选择的论文。有可选论文时，团队会通知您。"

msgid "Edit your proposal"
msgstr "编辑您的提议"

msgid "Propose an error or a missing step that the team did not prepare: where it is, what would change, why it matters, and how to fix it."
msgstr "提议团队未准备的错误或缺失步骤：它在哪里、会改变什么、为什么重要，以及如何修正。"

msgid "Save the proposal"
msgstr "保存提议"

msgid "Delete it"
msgstr "删除"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Edit"
msgstr "编辑"

msgid "Matrix"
msgstr "矩阵视图"

msgid "This item was saved from another tab or window after you opened this page. The saved answer is shown below; please make your change again."
msgstr "在您打开此页面之后，此条目已在另一个标签页或窗口中被保存。下方显示的是已保存的回答；请重新进行您的修改。"

msgid "Whole picture"
msgstr "全局视图"

msgid "Results"
msgstr "结果"

msgid "Previous"
msgstr "上一项"

msgid "Next"
msgstr "下一项"

msgid "This key point was prepared in two versions; both are shown with equal weight."
msgstr "这个关键点准备了两个版本，两者以同等权重显示。"

msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "正在保存…"

msgid "Saved"
msgstr "已保存"

msgid "Not saved: this item was changed in another tab. Reload the page."
msgstr "未保存：此条目已在另一个标签页中被修改。请重新加载页面。"

msgid "Not saved: no connection. Your text is still here; try again."
msgstr "未保存：没有网络连接。您的文字仍保留在这里，请重试。"

msgid "Not saved: please check the highlighted fields."
msgstr "未保存：请检查标出的字段。"

msgid "Not saved: the review is frozen."
msgstr "未保存：审阅已被冻结。"

msgid "Reasons, ticks, and comments"
msgstr "理由、勾选项和评论"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

msgid "Shortcuts: arrow keys for previous and next; K, C, R, U for the four answers."
msgstr "快捷键：左右方向键切换上一项和下一项；K、C、R、U 分别对应四种回答（保留、修改后保留、拒绝、不确定）。"

msgid "Back to the map"
msgstr "返回全局视图"

msgid "Results and items"
msgstr "结果与条目"

msgid "Each mark shows an item that affects a result. Select an item to review it."
msgstr "每个标记表示一个影响该结果的条目。选择一个条目即可审阅。"

msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"
